 ],
 "literal": "Born ... [or of another family], because of feeding milk, saying [it is milk] / the mother who gave birth indeed is not one who refuses [the alliance] / the young son of a strong warrior who says \"what is education?\" / is a good man with a bright spear, and that being so / while those who perished die, the relatives of those who survived / not obtaining protectors, will perish, / this woman's beauty will cause a great desolation of dusty-headed ruin.",
 "translation": "Whether she is born in this family or another, since she was fed milk, her mother who gave birth to her does not refuse her hand. The young son of the strong warrior, who asks 'What is education?' and wields a bright spear, is a capable man. Since that is so, while those who fought and perished are gone, the surviving relatives of the dead, finding no protectors, will also perish. This woman's beauty will cause a great, dusty-headed desolation.",
 "modern": "இவள் இந்தக்குடியில் பிறந்தவளோ அல்லது வேறு குடியைச் சேர்ந்தவளோ, இவளுக்குப் பாலூட்டி வளர்த்ததால் இவளைப் பெற்ற தாய் இவளது திருமணத்தை மறுப்பவள் அல்லள். 'கல்வி என்றால் என்ன?' என்று கேட்கும் வலிமைமிக்க வீரனின் இளமகன், ஒளிரும் வேலை ஏந்திய நல்ல வீரன் ஆவான். நிலைமை இவ்வாறிருக்க, போரில் அழிந்தவர்கள் அழிய, எஞ்சியிருக்கும் சுற்றத்தாரோ தங்களைக் காப்பாரைப் பெறாமல் அழிந்து போவர். இவளுடைய அழகு, புழுதி படிந்த பெரும் பாழடைதலை உண்டாக்கும்.",
 "explanation": "This poem belongs to the Makaṭpāṟ Kāñci theme, where a conflict arises because a girl's hand in marriage is refused to a powerful suitor. An onlooker or mediator describes the impending tragedy of the town. The mother of the girl does not object to the marriage, having raised her with care. The suitor is a fierce young warrior who disdains peaceful education and relies solely on his bright spear. Because of the pride and refusal of the girl's father or clan, a devastating war is inevitable. In this war, the warriors will perish, and their surviving relatives, left without protectors, will also die, turning the settlement into a dusty, ruined desolation.",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
